        "original_id": "9d324423-da3b-5df8-a0b2-4db0dec276b8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Felipe Calderón\n- Places: La Yesca Dam, Grande de Santiago River\n- Roles: President of Mexico\n- Events: La Yesca Dam inauguration, La Yesca Dam completion, El Cajón Dam completion\n\nFacts:\n- Felipe Calderón was born on 18 August 1962.\n- Felipe Calderón served as President of Mexico from 1 December 2006 to 30 November 2012.\n- The El Cajón Dam downstream on the Grande de Santiago River was completed in 2007.\n- The La Yesca Dam at La Yesca on the Grande de Santiago River was completed in 2012.\n- President Felipe Calderón inaugurated the La Yesca Dam on 6 November 2012.",
